HAI 1.3

BTW ==========================================================================
BTW  JAJAJA runtime / libreria — LOLCODE 1.3 (runtime externo: lci)
BTW  Este archivo es ARMADO con tools/build_lol.py desde src/parts/*.lol
BTW  No edites el archivo ensamblado directamente; edita las partes.
BTW ==========================================================================

I HAS A NL ITZ ":)"
I HAS A TAB ITZ ":(09)"
I HAS A SPC ITZ " "
I HAS A TILD ITZ "~"
I HAS A HASH ITZ "#"

I HAS A PATSEP ITZ A BUKKIT
PATSEP HAS A SRS 0 ITZ ":"
PATSEP HAS A SRS 1 ITZ ":"
PATSEP HAS A SRS 2 ITZ "="

BTW ---- FIND: indice leftmost de NDL en HAY (bukkits); -1 si no hay ----
HOW IZ I FIND YR HAY AN YR HN AN YR NDL AN YR NN
  BOTH SAEM NN AN BIGGR OF NN AN SUM OF HN AN 1, O RLY?
    YA RLY
      FOUND YR -1
  OIC
  I HAS A K ITZ 0
  I HAS A RES ITZ -1
  I HAS A LIMIT ITZ DIFF OF HN AN NN
  IM IN YR SCAN
    DIFFRINT K AN BIGGR OF K AN SUM OF LIMIT AN 1, O RLY?
      YA RLY
        I HAS A HIT ITZ 1
        I HAS A J ITZ 0
        IM IN YR CMP
          BOTH SAEM J AN NN, O RLY?
            YA RLY
              GTFO
          OIC
          BOTH SAEM HAY'Z SRS SUM OF K AN J AN NDL'Z SRS J, O RLY?
            YA RLY
            NO WAI
              HIT R 0
              GTFO
          OIC
          J R SUM OF J AN 1
        IM OUTTA YR CMP
        HIT, O RLY?
          YA RLY
            RES R K
            GTFO
        OIC
        K R SUM OF K AN 1
      NO WAI
        GTFO
    OIC
  IM OUTTA YR SCAN
  FOUND YR RES
IF U SAY SO

BTW ---- estado global de la maquina (bukkits sobreviven a los bloques) ----
I HAS A RULES ITZ A BUKKIT
I HAS A NRULES ITZ 0
I HAS A BASE ITZ A BUKKIT
I HAS A BLEN ITZ 0
I HAS A OUTB ITZ A BUKKIT
I HAS A OUTN ITZ 0
I HAS A INP ITZ A BUKKIT
I HAS A INPLEN ITZ 0
I HAS A LINE ITZ A BUKKIT
I HAS A LN ITZ 0
I HAS A LINENO ITZ 0
I HAS A MODE ITZ "rules"
I HAS A STEPS ITZ 0
I HAS A STAT ITZ "RUNNING"
I HAS A MAXS ITZ 200000

BTW ---- helpers de la maquina ----

HOW IZ I MKBUKKIT
  I HAS A B ITZ A BUKKIT
  FOUND YR B
IF U SAY SO

BTW APPENDOUT: agrega un char al buffer de salida
HOW IZ I APPENDOUT YR C
  OUTB HAS A SRS OUTN ITZ C
  OUTN R SUM OF OUTN AN 1
  FOUND YR 1
IF U SAY SO

BTW SETBASE: sustituye la base por un bukkit nuevo
HOW IZ I SETBASE YR NB AN YR NLN
  BASE R NB
  BLEN R NLN
  FOUND YR 1
IF U SAY SO

BTW OUTYARN: devuelve el buffer de salida como yarn
HOW IZ I OUTYARN
  I HAS A S ITZ ""
  I HAS A OI ITZ 0
  IM IN YR JOIN
    BOTH SAEM OI AN OUTN, O RLY?
      YA RLY
        GTFO
    OIC
    S R SMOOSH S AN OUTB'Z SRS OI MKAY
    OI R SUM OF OI AN 1
  IM OUTTA YR JOIN
  FOUND YR S
IF U SAY SO

BTW ---- LINEHANDLE: procesa la linea actual LINE (len LN) segun MODE ----
HOW IZ I LINEHANDLE
  LINENO R SUM OF LINENO AN 1
  BOTH SAEM MODE AN "rules", O RLY?
    YA RLY
      BOTH SAEM LN AN 0, O RLY?
        YA RLY
          FOUND YR "skip"
      OIC
      BOTH SAEM LINE'Z SRS 0 AN HASH, O RLY?
        YA RLY
          FOUND YR "skip-comment"
      OIC
      BTW cuenta espacios/tabs iniciales
      I HAS A LWS ITZ 0
      IM IN YR SKIPWS
        BOTH SAEM LWS AN LN, O RLY?
          YA RLY
            GTFO
        OIC
        EITHER OF BOTH SAEM LINE'Z SRS LWS AN SPC AN BOTH SAEM LINE'Z SRS LWS AN TAB, O RLY?
          YA RLY
            LWS R SUM OF LWS AN 1
          NO WAI
            GTFO
        OIC
      IM OUTTA YR SKIPWS
      BTW tambien recorta trailing ws (oracle: ln.strip() == "::=")
      I HAS A TWS ITZ 0
      I HAS A LASTC ITZ 0
      IM IN YR SKTW
        BOTH SAEM DIFF OF LN AN TWS AN LWS, O RLY?
          YA RLY
            GTFO
        OIC
        LASTC R DIFF OF DIFF OF LN AN TWS AN 1
        EITHER OF BOTH SAEM LINE'Z SRS LASTC AN SPC AN BOTH SAEM LINE'Z SRS LASTC AN TAB, O RLY?
          YA RLY
            TWS R SUM OF TWS AN 1
          NO WAI
            GTFO
        OIC
      IM OUTTA YR SKTW
      I HAS A REST ITZ DIFF OF DIFF OF LN AN LWS AN TWS
      I HAS A ISSEP ITZ 0
      BOTH SAEM REST AN 3, O RLY?
        YA RLY
          I HAS A C1 ITZ LINE'Z SRS LWS
          I HAS A C2 ITZ LINE'Z SRS SUM OF LWS AN 1
          I HAS A C3 ITZ LINE'Z SRS SUM OF LWS AN 2
          I HAS A P1 ITZ BOTH SAEM C1 AN ":"
          I HAS A P2 ITZ BOTH SAEM C2 AN ":"
          I HAS A P3 ITZ BOTH SAEM C3 AN "="
          BOTH SAEM BOTH OF P1 AN BOTH OF P2 AN P3 AN WIN, O RLY?
            YA RLY
              ISSEP R 1
          OIC
      OIC
      ISSEP, O RLY?
        YA RLY
          MODE R "base"
          FOUND YR "separator"
      OIC
      I HAS A KF ITZ I IZ FIND YR LINE AN YR LN AN YR PATSEP AN YR 3 MKAY
      BOTH SAEM KF AN -1, O RLY?
        YA RLY
          STAT R "SYNTAX_ERROR"
          FOUND YR "syntax-error"
      OIC
      BTW crea la regla
      I HAS A LHSB ITZ A BUKKIT
      I HAS A Q ITZ 0
      IM IN YR CL
        BOTH SAEM Q AN KF, O RLY?
          YA RLY
            GTFO
        OIC
        LHSB HAS A SRS Q ITZ LINE'Z SRS Q
        Q R SUM OF Q AN 1
      IM OUTTA YR CL
      I HAS A RHSB ITZ A BUKKIT
      I HAS A RLENO ITZ DIFF OF LN AN SUM OF KF AN 3
      I HAS A W ITZ 0
      IM IN YR CW
        BOTH SAEM W AN RLENO, O RLY?
          YA RLY
            GTFO
        OIC
        RHSB HAS A SRS W ITZ LINE'Z SRS SUM OF KF AN SUM OF 3 AN W
        W R SUM OF W AN 1
      IM OUTTA YR CW
      I HAS A REC ITZ A BUKKIT
      REC HAS A L ITZ LHSB
      REC HAS A LL ITZ KF
      REC HAS A T ITZ RHSB
      REC HAS A TN ITZ RLENO
      REC HAS A EM ITZ 0
      BOTH SAEM RLENO AN BIGGR OF RLENO AN 1, O RLY?
        YA RLY
          BOTH SAEM RHSB'Z SRS 0 AN TILD, O RLY?
            YA RLY
              REC'Z EM R 1
          OIC
      OIC
      RULES HAS A SRS NRULES ITZ REC
      NRULES R SUM OF NRULES AN 1
      FOUND YR "rule"
    NO WAI
      BTW MODE base: primera linea no-blanca y no-comentario es la base
      I HAS A LWS ITZ 0
      IM IN YR SK2
        BOTH SAEM LWS AN LN, O RLY?
          YA RLY
            GTFO
        OIC
        EITHER OF BOTH SAEM LINE'Z SRS LWS AN SPC AN BOTH SAEM LINE'Z SRS LWS AN TAB, O RLY?
          YA RLY
            LWS R SUM OF LWS AN 1
          NO WAI
            GTFO
        OIC
      IM OUTTA YR SK2
      BOTH SAEM LWS AN LN, O RLY?
        YA RLY
          FOUND YR "skip-blank"
      OIC
      BOTH SAEM LINE'Z SRS LWS AN HASH, O RLY?
        YA RLY
          FOUND YR "skip-comment"
      OIC
      I HAS A BQ ITZ 0
      IM IN YR CB
        BOTH SAEM BQ AN LN, O RLY?
          YA RLY
            GTFO
        OIC
        BASE HAS A SRS BQ ITZ LINE'Z SRS BQ
        BQ R SUM OF BQ AN 1
      IM OUTTA YR CB
      BLEN R LN
      MODE R "after"
      FOUND YR "base"
  OIC
  FOUND YR "noop"
IF U SAY SO

BTW ---- maquina de Markov (rewrite ordenado; primera regla aplicable gana;
BTW      sustituye / emite de acuerdo a la especificacion) ----
HOW IZ I RUNMACHINE
IM IN YR MACH
  BOTH SAEM STAT AN "RUNNING", O RLY?
    YA RLY
    NO WAI
      GTFO
  OIC
  BOTH SAEM STEPS AN MAXS, O RLY?
    YA RLY
      GTFO
  OIC
  BTW intenta aplicar la primera regla cuyo lhs aparezca
  I HAS A RI ITZ 0
  I HAS A DID ITZ 0
  IM IN YR TRYR
    BOTH SAEM RI AN NRULES, O RLY?
      YA RLY
        GTFO
    OIC
    I HAS A RUL ITZ RULES'Z SRS RI
    BOTH SAEM RUL'Z LL AN 0, O RLY?
      YA RLY
        BTW lhs vacio: skip
      NO WAI
        I HAS A IDX ITZ I IZ FIND YR BASE AN YR BLEN AN YR RUL'Z L AN YR RUL'Z LL MKAY
        DIFFRINT IDX AN -1, O RLY?
          YA RLY
            BTW aplica: construye nueva base
            I HAS A NB3 ITZ A BUKKIT
            I HAS A WI ITZ 0
            I HAS A P1 ITZ 0
            IM IN YR PL
              BOTH SAEM P1 AN IDX, O RLY?
                YA RLY
                  GTFO
              OIC
              NB3 HAS A SRS WI ITZ BASE'Z SRS P1
              WI R SUM OF WI AN 1
              P1 R SUM OF P1 AN 1
            IM OUTTA YR PL
            RUL'Z EM, O RLY?
              YA RLY
                BTW emision: rhs[1:] al output (o newline si vacio)
                BOTH SAEM RUL'Z TN AN 1, O RLY?
                  YA RLY
                    I HAS A EMRES ITZ I IZ APPENDOUT YR NL MKAY
                  NO WAI
                    I HAS A TE ITZ 0
                    IM IN YR EMIT
                      BOTH SAEM TE AN DIFF OF RUL'Z TN AN 1, O RLY?
                        YA RLY
                          GTFO
                      OIC
                      I HAS A EMRES2 ITZ I IZ APPENDOUT YR RUL'Z T'Z SRS SUM OF TE AN 1 MKAY
                      TE R SUM OF TE AN 1
                    IM OUTTA YR EMIT
                OIC
              NO WAI
                BTW reemplazo: inserta rhs completo
                I HAS A TI ITZ 0
                IM IN YR INS
                  BOTH SAEM TI AN RUL'Z TN, O RLY?
                    YA RLY
                      GTFO
                  OIC
                  NB3 HAS A SRS WI ITZ RUL'Z T'Z SRS TI
                  WI R SUM OF WI AN 1
                  TI R SUM OF TI AN 1
                IM OUTTA YR INS
            OIC
            BTW sufijo tras el match
            I HAS A P2 ITZ SUM OF IDX AN RUL'Z LL
            IM IN YR SUF
              BOTH SAEM P2 AN BLEN, O RLY?
                YA RLY
                  GTFO
              OIC
              NB3 HAS A SRS WI ITZ BASE'Z SRS P2
              WI R SUM OF WI AN 1
              P2 R SUM OF P2 AN 1
            IM OUTTA YR SUF
            I HAS A DONEIT ITZ I IZ SETBASE YR NB3 AN YR WI MKAY
            STEPS R SUM OF STEPS AN 1
            DID R 1
            GTFO
        OIC
      OIC
    RI R SUM OF RI AN 1
  IM OUTTA YR TRYR
  DID, O RLY?
    YA RLY
    NO WAI
      GTFO
  OIC
IM OUTTA YR MACH
BTW cierre semantico: si ninguna regla matcheo ya es HALT (afin). Si
BTW sigue RUNNING por presupuesto, queda MAX_STEPS en el driver/test.
FOUND YR 1
IF U SAY SO

BTW ---- status final: si no paro solo, el presupuesto manda ----
HOW IZ I FINISHSTATUS
  BOTH SAEM STAT AN "RUNNING", O RLY?
    YA RLY
      BOTH SAEM STEPS AN MAXS, O RLY?
        YA RLY
          STAT R "MAX_STEPS"
        NO WAI
          STAT R "HALTED"
      OIC
  OIC
  FOUND YR 1
IF U SAY SO

BTW ---- RESETMACH: reinicia el estado de la maquina entre tests ----
HOW IZ I RESETMACH
  RULES R I IZ MKBUKKIT MKAY
  NRULES R 0
  BASE R I IZ MKBUKKIT MKAY
  BLEN R 0
  OUTB R I IZ MKBUKKIT MKAY
  OUTN R 0
  STEPS R 0
  STAT R "RUNNING"
  LINENO R 0
  MODE R "rules"
  MAXS R 200000
  FOUND YR 1
IF U SAY SO

BTW ==== TESTKIT: helpers para escribir tests en LOLCODE ====

I HAS A TPASS ITZ 0
I HAS A TFAIL ITZ 0

HOW IZ I REPORT YR NAM AN YR OK
  OK, O RLY?
    YA RLY
      VISIBLE "PASS "!
VISIBLE NAM
      TPASS R SUM OF TPASS AN 1
    NO WAI
      VISIBLE "FAIL "!
VISIBLE NAM
      TFAIL R SUM OF TFAIL AN 1
  OIC
  FOUND YR 1
IF U SAY SO

HOW IZ I EXPECT YR NAM AN YR GOT AN YR WANT
  I HAS A OK ITZ BOTH SAEM GOT AN WANT
  I HAS A RRQ ITZ I IZ REPORT YR NAM AN YR OK MKAY
  BOTH SAEM OK AN FAIL, O RLY?
    YA RLY
      VISIBLE "    got="!
VISIBLE GOT
      VISIBLE "    want="!
VISIBLE WANT
  OIC
  FOUND YR OK
IF U SAY SO

HOW IZ I EXPECTYARN YR NAM AN YR GOT AN YR WANT
  FOUND YR I IZ EXPECT YR NAM AN YR GOT AN YR WANT MKAY
IF U SAY SO

BTW MKLINE1..8: arma una linea fuente a partir de chars (para tests)
HOW IZ I MKLINE1 YR C1
  I HAS A L ITZ I IZ MKBUKKIT MKAY
  L HAS A SRS 0 ITZ C1
  FOUND YR L
IF U SAY SO
HOW IZ I MKLINE2 YR C1 AN YR C2
  I HAS A L ITZ I IZ MKLINE1 YR C1 MKAY
  L HAS A SRS 1 ITZ C2
  FOUND YR L
IF U SAY SO
HOW IZ I MKLINE3 YR C1 AN YR C2 AN YR C3
  I HAS A L ITZ I IZ MKLINE2 YR C1 AN YR C2 MKAY
  L HAS A SRS 2 ITZ C3
  FOUND YR L
IF U SAY SO
HOW IZ I MKLINE4 YR C1 AN YR C2 AN YR C3 AN YR C4
  I HAS A L ITZ I IZ MKLINE3 YR C1 AN YR C2 AN YR C3 MKAY
  L HAS A SRS 3 ITZ C4
  FOUND YR L
IF U SAY SO
HOW IZ I MKLINE5 YR C1 AN YR C2 AN YR C3 AN YR C4 AN YR C5
  I HAS A L ITZ I IZ MKLINE4 YR C1 AN YR C2 AN YR C3 AN YR C4 MKAY
  L HAS A SRS 4 ITZ C5
  FOUND YR L
IF U SAY SO
HOW IZ I MKLINE6 YR C1 AN YR C2 AN YR C3 AN YR C4 AN YR C5 AN YR C6
  I HAS A L ITZ I IZ MKLINE5 YR C1 AN YR C2 AN YR C3 AN YR C4 AN YR C5 MKAY
  L HAS A SRS 5 ITZ C6
  FOUND YR L
IF U SAY SO
HOW IZ I MKLINE7 YR C1 AN YR C2 AN YR C3 AN YR C4 AN YR C5 AN YR C6 AN YR C7
  I HAS A L ITZ I IZ MKLINE6 YR C1 AN YR C2 AN YR C3 AN YR C4 AN YR C5 AN YR C6 MKAY
  L HAS A SRS 6 ITZ C7
  FOUND YR L
IF U SAY SO
HOW IZ I MKLINE8 YR C1 AN YR C2 AN YR C3 AN YR C4 AN YR C5 AN YR C6 AN YR C7 AN YR C8
  I HAS A L ITZ I IZ MKLINE7 YR C1 AN YR C2 AN YR C3 AN YR C4 AN YR C5 AN YR C6 AN YR C7 MKAY
  L HAS A SRS 7 ITZ C8
  FOUND YR L
IF U SAY SO

BTW FEEDLINE: entrega una linea (bukkit) al parser
HOW IZ I FEEDLINE YR LBUF AN YR LLEN
  LINE R LBUF
  LN R LLEN
  I HAS A RRQ ITZ I IZ LINEHANDLE MKAY
  FOUND YR RRQ
IF U SAY SO

BTW PUSHCH/ENDLINE: escribe una linea caracter a caracter, como el driver
BTW de transporte lo haria con el stream; la misma LINE queda armada.
BTW TRUCO lci: pasar una yarn ":" como ultimo argumento de una funcion
BTW dispara un lexer bug de lci (se traga la comilla de cierre y sigue).
BTW Workaround demostrado: GETCOLON anida la llamada y devuelve ":" limpio.
HOW IZ I GETCOLON
  FOUND YR ":"
IF U SAY SO

HOW IZ I PUSHCOLON
  I HAS A C ITZ I IZ GETCOLON MKAY
  I HAS A RQ ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR C MKAY
  FOUND YR RQ
IF U SAY SO
HOW IZ I PUSHCH YR C
  LINE HAS A SRS LN ITZ C
  LN R SUM OF LN AN 1
  FOUND YR 1
IF U SAY SO

HOW IZ I ENDLINE
  I HAS A RRQ ITZ I IZ LINEHANDLE MKAY
  I HAS A FLINE ITZ I IZ MKBUKKIT MKAY
  LINE R FLINE
  LN R 0
  FOUND YR RRQ
IF U SAY SO

BTW ==== MAIN:: tests nativos del runtime LOLCODE ====
BTW Cada test arma y ejecuta un programa tiny por el mismo camino del
BTW parser/maquina, y compara (output, steps, status) contra valores
BTW esperados literalmente escritos (fijados contra el oraculo Python).

I HAS A TCNT ITZ 0
I HAS A TRES ITZ 0

BTW helper:: base como yarn (para asserts)
HOW IZ I BASEYARN
  I HAS A S ITZ ""
  I HAS A I ITZ 0
  IM IN YR LP
    BOTH SAEM I AN BLEN, O RLY?
      YA RLY
        GTFO
    OIC
    S R SMOOSH S AN BASE'Z SRS I MKAY
    I R SUM OF I AN 1
  IM OUTTA YR LP
  FOUND YR S
IF U SAY SO

BTW ---- run:: secuenciar chars de una fuente incluyendo '\n' via NL ----

BTW t01:: parseo de una regla -> 1 regla cargada
I HAS A TX ITZ I IZ RESETMACH MKAY
I HAS A D01 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "j" MKAY
I HAS A D02 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "j" MKAY
I HAS A D03 ITZ I IZ PUSHCOLON MKAY
I HAS A D04 ITZ I IZ PUSHCOLON MKAY
I HAS A D05 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "=" MKAY
I HAS A D06 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "x" MKAY
I HAS A D07 ITZ I IZ ENDLINE MKAY
TRES R I IZ EXPECT YR "t01 parse 1 regla" AN YR NRULES AN YR 1 MKAY

BTW t02:: rewrite basico a::::=b sobre base a -> base=b, steps=1, HALTED
I HAS A TX1 ITZ I IZ RESETMACH MKAY
I HAS A E01 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "a" MKAY
I HAS A E02 ITZ I IZ PUSHCOLON MKAY
I HAS A E03 ITZ I IZ PUSHCOLON MKAY
I HAS A E04 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "=" MKAY
I HAS A E05 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "b" MKAY
I HAS A E06 ITZ I IZ ENDLINE MKAY
BTW separador
I HAS A E07 ITZ I IZ PUSHCOLON MKAY
I HAS A E08 ITZ I IZ PUSHCOLON MKAY
I HAS A E09 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "=" MKAY
I HAS A E10 ITZ I IZ ENDLINE MKAY
BTW base
I HAS A E11 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "a" MKAY
I HAS A E12 ITZ I IZ ENDLINE MKAY
I HAS A M1 ITZ I IZ RUNMACHINE MKAY
I HAS A FSH ITZ I IZ FINISHSTATUS MKAY
TRES R I IZ EXPECTYARN YR "t02a base" AN YR I IZ BASEYARN MKAY AN YR "b" MKAY
TRES R I IZ EXPECT YR "t02b steps" AN YR STEPS AN YR 1 MKAY
TRES R I IZ EXPECTYARN YR "t02c status" AN YR STAT AN YR "HALTED" MKAY

BTW t03:: emision ~ borra match y escribe output
I HAS A TX3 ITZ I IZ RESETMACH MKAY
I HAS A C01 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "a" MKAY
I HAS A C02 ITZ I IZ PUSHCOLON MKAY
I HAS A C03 ITZ I IZ PUSHCOLON MKAY
I HAS A C04 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "=" MKAY
I HAS A C05 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "~" MKAY
I HAS A C06 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "h" MKAY
I HAS A C07 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "i" MKAY
I HAS A C08 ITZ I IZ ENDLINE MKAY
I HAS A C09 ITZ I IZ PUSHCOLON MKAY
I HAS A C10 ITZ I IZ PUSHCOLON MKAY
I HAS A C11 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "=" MKAY
I HAS A C12 ITZ I IZ ENDLINE MKAY
I HAS A C13 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "a" MKAY
I HAS A C14 ITZ I IZ ENDLINE MKAY
I HAS A M3 ITZ I IZ RUNMACHINE MKAY
TRES R I IZ EXPECTYARN YR "t03a output" AN YR I IZ OUTYARN MKAY AN YR "hi" MKAY
TRES R I IZ EXPECTYARN YR "t03b base" AN YR I IZ BASEYARN MKAY AN YR "" MKAY

BTW t04:: ~ solo emite newline
I HAS A TX4 ITZ I IZ RESETMACH MKAY
I HAS A B01 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "j" MKAY
I HAS A B02 ITZ I IZ PUSHCOLON MKAY
I HAS A B03 ITZ I IZ PUSHCOLON MKAY
I HAS A B04 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "=" MKAY
I HAS A B05 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "~" MKAY
I HAS A B06 ITZ I IZ ENDLINE MKAY
I HAS A B07 ITZ I IZ PUSHCOLON MKAY
I HAS A B08 ITZ I IZ PUSHCOLON MKAY
I HAS A B09 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "=" MKAY
I HAS A B10 ITZ I IZ ENDLINE MKAY
I HAS A B11 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "j" MKAY
I HAS A B12 ITZ I IZ ENDLINE MKAY
I HAS A M4 ITZ I IZ RUNMACHINE MKAY
TRES R I IZ EXPECT YR "t04 outlen" AN YR OUTN AN YR 1 MKAY
TRES R I IZ EXPECTYARN YR "t04 nl" AN YR OUTB'Z SRS 0 AN YR NL MKAY

BTW t05:: leftmost (ab en ababa:: solo el primero se reescribe)
I HAS A TX5 ITZ I IZ RESETMACH MKAY
I HAS A F01 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "a" MKAY
I HAS A F02 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "b" MKAY
I HAS A F03 ITZ I IZ PUSHCOLON MKAY
I HAS A F04 ITZ I IZ PUSHCOLON MKAY
I HAS A F05 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "=" MKAY
I HAS A F06 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "X" MKAY
I HAS A F07 ITZ I IZ ENDLINE MKAY
I HAS A F08 ITZ I IZ PUSHCOLON MKAY
I HAS A F09 ITZ I IZ PUSHCOLON MKAY
I HAS A F10 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "=" MKAY
I HAS A F11 ITZ I IZ ENDLINE MKAY
I HAS A F12 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "a" MKAY
I HAS A F13 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "b" MKAY
I HAS A F14 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "a" MKAY
I HAS A F15 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "b" MKAY
I HAS A F16 ITZ I IZ ENDLINE MKAY
I HAS A M5 ITZ I IZ RUNMACHINE MKAY
TRES R I IZ EXPECTYARN YR "t05 leftmost" AN YR I IZ BASEYARN MKAY AN YR "XX" MKAY

BTW t06:: orden de reglas — primera aplicable gana
I HAS A TX6 ITZ I IZ RESETMACH MKAY
I HAS A G01 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "a" MKAY
I HAS A G02 ITZ I IZ PUSHCOLON MKAY
I HAS A G03 ITZ I IZ PUSHCOLON MKAY
I HAS A G04 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "=" MKAY
I HAS A G05 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "1" MKAY
I HAS A G06 ITZ I IZ ENDLINE MKAY
I HAS A G07 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "a" MKAY
I HAS A G08 ITZ I IZ PUSHCOLON MKAY
I HAS A G09 ITZ I IZ PUSHCOLON MKAY
I HAS A G10 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "=" MKAY
I HAS A G11 ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR "2" MKAY
I HAS A G12 ITZ I IZ ENDLINE MKAY
I HAS A G13 ITZ I IZ PUSHCOLON MKAY
